# Accepted Trivy findings. Used by the Jenkins "Scan images" stage (--ignorefile).
# Every entry needs a reason and an expiry date; after the date Trivy reports it again and the build fails.

# CVE-2026-47884 (spring-webmvc, XsltView path traversal -> SSRF/RCE). Only exploitable when the app renders
# views with XsltView; no Diwan service uses XsltView or any view resolver (REST/JSON only). No open-source
# 6.x fix exists (only Spring Framework 7.0.9, which needs Spring Boot 4). Remove when moving to Boot 4.
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2027-01-31
